  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the continuity of education services and recovery of the education sector from the impacts of crisis and displacement inAden, Lahj, and Ta&#x2019;iz governorates</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The education system in Yemen has suffered from years of conflict and seasonal floods that have caused extensive damage to infrastructure including schools, thereby reducing access to educational services for children. The objective of the project is to contribute to the continuity, improvement of education services in crisis and displacement affected communities in Aden, Lahj and Ta&apos;iz governorates. The project also aims to mitigate tensions in displacement affected communities due to competition for limited services and resources through expanding the capacity of schools to accommodate a larger number of students, including students among internally displaced persons (IDPs), returnees, and host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
